*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% LabelWerk - Test-PPD fuer die Filter-Tests (Driver/filter/tests).
*% Enthaelt alle lw*-Optionen aus ARCHITECTURE.md Abschnitt 9 und die PPD-Attribute
*% *lwModel, *lwMaxPrintWidthDots und *lwDefaultGapDots. Nicht zur Installation bestimmt -
*% die echten PPDs erzeugt Driver/ppd/generate_ppds.py. Nur ASCII.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LWTEST.PPD"
*Product: "(LabelWerk Test)"
*Manufacturer: "Zebra"
*ModelName: "LabelWerk Test"
*ShortNickName: "LabelWerk Test"
*NickName: "Zebra LabelWerk Test (203 dpi)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "6"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertolabelwerk"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-command 0 commandtolabelwerk"
*cupsCommands: "Clean PrintSelfTestPage ReportLevels AutoConfigure Calibrate"
*lwModel: "zd421t"
*lwMaxPrintWidthDots: "832"
*lwDefaultGapDots: "24"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w288h432
*PageSize w288h432/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w144h72/2 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[144 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
